</div>

A standalone terminal UI for the **official [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)**, rendered with [`@earendil-works/pi-tui`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@earendil-works/pi-tui).

@chalk/dsh-tui README · Requirements：- Node.js 22.19 or newer
- A DeepSeek API key
- macOS, Linux, or Windows

@chalk/dsh-tui README · Run：The footer shows approximate context occupancy against the active model's capacity, for example `ctx ~42K/1M (4%)`. The estimate describes the next prompt rather than billing usage and updates immediately after compaction. Before the first provider usage sample, the footer shows the known capacity as `ctx —/1M`.

Unknown slash commands are offered to the official Harness command service. Their availability depends on the composed profile.

